If you're at level twelve, Gehennom may be a few levels further than
you think...

My best advice is to get yourself a spellbook of healing or extra
healing, a magic whistle and a stethoscope - keep checking your pets
health, and healing as needed. I usually find that by the time I get
to this point in the game, pets are not worth the hassle of keeping
them around and healthy, unless you're riding them. Also, there are
better pets than dragons in the game (although nothing beats the
mental image of a pet dragon!)

